wf-bonfire-fed = You put fuel on { THE($fire) }.
wf-bonfire-full = { CAPITALIZE(THE($fire)) } has all the fuel it can hold.
wf-bonfire-lit = You light { THE($fire) }.
wf-bonfire-nothing = There's nothing left in { THE($fire) } to burn.
wf-bonfire-examine-burning = It's burning well.
wf-bonfire-examine-low = It's burning low and will go out soon. It needs more wood.
wf-bonfire-examine-out-fuel = It's out. There's still fuel in it, and a flame would light it.
wf-bonfire-examine-out = It's out and burnt down to ash. It needs wood and a flame.
